    title: "taint ships no code- or DOM-injection sink: every shipped zone derives from an I/O boundary and in-process eval crosses none; JS also emits no edge for bare eval, new Function or an innerHTML assignment"  # c296
    status: todo_hard  # c296
    priority: 3  # c296
    parent:  # c296
    tags:  # c296
    - taint  # c296
